From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:33:43 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: convert a frame outside the read lock

One lock serialized every reader across its frame wait and its
convert, and all readers shared one converter. A second reader waited
for the first's whole read, even when both could use the frame the
stream already held.
---
 xbmc/utils/AMLCapture.cpp | 211 +++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 xbmc/utils/AMLCapture.h   |  44 +++++---
 2 files changed, 170 insertions(+), 85 deletions(-)

